---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Business Process Automation & Custom Software Services | Static Pulse Sites"
  description="Explore website development, AI systems and automation, and custom internal software built for small and medium businesses."
>
  <main class="services-page">
    <section class="services-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="image-band">
          <div class="image-band-copy">
            <h1>Business systems built around the way your company works</h1>

            <p class="lead hero-lead">
              Static Pulse Sites helps small and medium businesses improve their
              public-facing websites, automate repetitive processes, and build
              focused internal software when existing tools are not enough.
            </p>

            <div class="button-row">
              <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
                Start Your Project
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="image-band-frame">
            <img
              src="/images/custom-coded-website-workspace.jpg"
              alt="Custom-coded website development workspace"
              loading="eager"
              width="1536"
              height="1024"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="services-heading">
          <h2>Three connected ways to improve your business</h2>

          <p>
            Each service can stand alone or become part of a larger system. We
            recommend the simplest solution that addresses the problem.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="services-grid">
          <a
            class="service-option"
            href="/services/website-development"
            aria-label="Explore custom website development for small businesses"
          >
            <div>
              <h3>Website Development</h3>

              <p>
                Fast, secure websites that support your customer journey and
                connect with the tools behind your business.
              </p>
            </div>

            <span>Explore Website Development →</span>
          </a>

          <a
            class="service-option"
            href="/services/ai-systems-automation"
            aria-label="Explore AI automation services for small businesses"
          >
            <div>
              <h3>AI Systems &amp; Automation</h3>

              <p>
                Practical workflows that connect your existing platforms and
                reduce repetitive manual work.
              </p>
            </div>

            <span>Explore AI Systems &amp; Automation →</span>
          </a>

          <a
            class="service-option"
            href="/services/custom-internal-software"
            aria-label="Explore custom internal software development"
          >
            <div>
              <h3>Custom Internal Software</h3>

              <p>
                Focused internal tools designed around the way your team manages
                clients, information, projects, and operations.
              </p>
            </div>

            <span>Explore Custom Internal Software →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="services-final-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="services-final-cta">
          <h2>Not sure which service fits the problem?</h2>

          <p>
            Tell us what is slowing your business down. You do not need to know
            which technology or service you need before contacting us.
          </p>

          <div class="services-button-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">
              Start Your Project
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .services-page {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .services-hero {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 4vw, 4.5rem) 0;
  }

  .services-hero .image-band {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  align-items: center;
}

.services-hero .image-band-frame {
  width: 100%;
  height: clamp(340px, 32vw, 460px);
  padding: 0.75rem;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.services-hero .image-band-frame img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: auto;
  object-fit: cover;
  object-position: center;
  border-radius: var(--radius);
}

  .image-band-copy h1 {
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .image-band-copy .hero-lead {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  .image-band-copy .button-row {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .services-section {
    padding: clamp(2.75rem, 4vw, 4rem) 0;
  }

  .services-heading {
    max-width: 950px;
    margin: 0 auto clamp(2.5rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .services-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .services-heading p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 1.15rem auto 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .services-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.75rem);
  }

  .service-option {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 100%;
    padding: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.25rem);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
    );
    transition:
      transform 180ms ease,
      border-color 180ms ease,
      background-color 180ms ease;
  }

  .service-option:hover,
  .service-option:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    background: rgba(24, 185, 215, 0.055);
  }

  .service-option:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid rgba(24, 185, 215, 0.35);
    outline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .service-option h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .service-option p {
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .service-option span {
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .services-final-section {
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 3vw, 3.25rem) 0
      clamp(3rem, 4vw, 4rem);
  }

  .services-final-cta {
    max-width: 1050px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 28px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top right,
        rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12),
        transparent 38%
      ),
      linear-gradient(
        180deg,
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045),
        rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015)
      );
  }

  .services-final-cta h2 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .services-final-cta > p {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .services-button-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .services-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .services-hero,
    .services-section {
      padding-top: 2.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .services-final-section {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .services-final-cta {
      padding: 2rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: 22px;
    }

    .service-option {
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .service-option {
      transition: none;
    }

    .service-option:hover {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>